# robot-feed.fk: the kit's robots back into a roboport (12x8)
# The kit's logistic and construction robots end up as items in a storage chest whenever a build
# takes up the roboport that held them (they are not lost, and nothing uses them there). This puts
# them back: a requester chest asks for them and one inserter drops them into the roboport.
# Place the plot on free ground next to the network, and let `cover power` power it.

port  = Roboport @(0, 0)
botin = Chest<requester, item="logistic-robot", request=50, rate=1/s> @(5, 1)
net load: botin -> port
